# `data/` holds baseline worlds and fixtures no image needs: nothing in any Dockerfile reads
# it.  It used to be carved open one level at a time so a single frozen structured-v1 manifest
# could pass as a build input; that package was retired on 2026-10-11 and its COPY went with
# it, so the plain exclusion is back and the carve-out is gone.
data
